        "arguments": ["nil dup 0 swap cons drop", "-9223372036854775808 nil cons", "7 8 nil cons cons"],
        "argument_spelling": "the design's `[]` is an empty `List I64`: a bare `nil` submission leaves the element type open, so its slot is not the retained `List I64` interface and is refused at injection typing (GUARD-CASE-12's refusal); `nil dup 0 swap cons drop` fixes the element type through a discarded cons and leaves exactly the empty list",
        "tail": "an I64 cell 41 at the bottom of the session, below the subject, the companion cells and the list argument",
        "nested": {
          "contract": "head-of-nonempty-nested: input (xs (List (List I64))), requires (not (is-nil (in xs))), ensures true",
